SUMMARY:Chaunte Wayans & Friends
LOCATION:The Stand Up Comedy Club\, Bellflower
DESCRIPTION:Chaunte Wayans & Friends takes over The Stand Up Comedy Club fo
 
r a pre-Halloween blowout stacked with comedic killers: Chaunte Wayans\, Da
 
mon Wayans Jr.\, Greg Baldwin\, Earthquake\, Brandon T. Jackson\, and Daphn
 
ique Springs. Chaunte has rocked Madison Square Garden\, Damon Wayans Jr. b
 
rought the laughs on New Girl and Happy Endings\, and Earthquake has multip
 
le Netflix specials under his belt. And because candy is for children\, we'
 
ve got raffles and prizes instead. Come laugh\, win stuff\, and make questi
 
onable pre-Halloween decisions. This lineup is scary good. Grab your ticket
 
s before they vanish without a trace. ************************************ 
 
SCAM ALERT -- IMPORTANT TICKET INFORMATION ********************************
 
**** To protect our customers\, please DO NOT purchase tickets from third-p
 
arty sites such as StubHub\, VividSeats\, BoxOfficeTicketSales\, EventTicke
 
tCenter\, eTickets\, Ticket-Center\, TicketSales\, or any other unauthorize
 
d platforms. These sellers are not affiliated with us and often charge infl
 
ated prices. All tickets purchased through our official site are WILL CALL 
 
